    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "{{ $vars.ADMIN_EMAIL }}",
        "subject": "🚨 URGENT: Atlas AI Signup Limit Violation - {{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.firstName }} {{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.lastName }}",
        "message": "=**IMMEDIATE ATTENTION REQUIRED**\n\n🚨 **User Signup Violation Alert**\n\n**User Information:**\n- Name: {{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.firstName }} {{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.lastName }}\n- Email: {{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.email }}\n- Company: {{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.company }}\n- User ID: {{ $('Initialize User Data').item.json.userId }}\n\n**Plan & Violation Details:**\n- Selected Plan: {{ $json.planDetails.planName }} (${{ $json.planDetails.monthlyPrice }}/month)\n- Plan Contact Limit: {{ $json.planDetails.features.contactLimit.toLocaleString() }}\n- User's Contact Count: {{ ($('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.initialContactCount || 0).toLocaleString() }}\n- Overage: {{ (($('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.initialContactCount || 0) - $json.planDetails.features.contactLimit).toLocaleString() }} contacts ({{ Math.round((($('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.initialContactCount || 0) / $json.planDetails.features.contactLimit - 1) * 100) }}% over limit)\n\n**Severity:** HIGH - User exceeds plan capacity at signup\n\n**Recommended Actions:**\n1. 📞 Contact user immediately about plan upgrade\n2. 📈 Offer Professional or Enterprise plan\n3. 🔒 Consider temporary account restrictions\n4. 💰 Negotiate custom pricing if needed\n\n**Upgrade Options:**\n{{ $json.planDetails.planName === 'Starter' ? '• Professional Plan: 25,000 contacts ($149/month)\\n• Enterprise Plan: Unlimited contacts ($449/month)' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planDetails.planName === 'Professional' ? '• Enterprise Plan: Unlimited contacts ($449/month)' : '' }}\n\n**Quick Actions:**\n- [View User Dashboard](https://sheets.google.com/spreadsheets/d/{{ $vars.USERS_DATABASE_SHEET_ID }})\n- [Contact User](mailto:{{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.email }}?subject=Atlas%20AI%20Plan%20Review%20Required)\n- [Upgrade Options](https://atlasai.com/admin/users/{{ $('Initialize User Data').item.json.userId }}/upgrade)\n\n**Account Details:**\n- Signup Date: {{ DateTime.fromISO($('Initialize User Data').item.json.signupTimestamp).toFormat('MMMM dd, yyyy HH:mm') }}\n- Trial End: {{ DateTime.fromISO($('Initialize User Data').item.json.trialEndDate).toFormat('MMMM dd, yyyy') }}\n- Features Activated: {{ $json.featureCount }} features\n\n---\n🤖 Atlas AI Automated Monitoring System\nAlert Generated: {{ DateTime.fromISO($now).toFormat('MMMM dd, yyyy HH:mm:ss') }}",
        "options": {
          "priority": "high",
          "replyTo": "admin@atlasai.com"
        }
      },
