    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "🚀 Welcome to Atlas AI - Your {{ $json.planDetails.planName }} Plan is Active!",
        "message": "=**Welcome to Atlas AI!**\n\nHi {{ $('📥 User Signup Webhook').item.json.firstName }},\n\nCongratulations! Your **{{ $json.planDetails.planName }} Plan** has been successfully activated and your account is ready to use.\n\n**Account Details:**\n- User ID: {{ $('Initialize User Data').item.json.userId }}\n- Plan: {{ $json.planDetails.planName }} (${{ $json.planDetails.monthlyPrice }}/month)\n- Trial Period: 14 days (ends {{ DateTime.fromISO($('Initialize User Data').item.json.trialEndDate).toFormat('MMMM dd, yyyy') }})\n- Account Status: {{ $('Initialize User Data').item.json.accountStatus | title }}\n\n**Your Activated Features ({{ $json.featureCount }} total):**\n{{ $json.activatedFeatures.map(feature => '✅ ' + feature).join('\\n') }}\n\n**Plan Specifications:**\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.contactLimit === -1 ? '📊 Unlimited contacts' : '📊 Up to ' + $json.planDetails.features.contactLimit.toLocaleString() + ' contacts' }}\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.aiCampaignsPerMonth === -1 ? '🤖 Unlimited AI campaigns per month' : '🤖 ' + $json.planDetails.features.aiCampaignsPerMonth + ' AI campaigns per month' }}\n👥 {{ $json.planDetails.features.teamMembersLimit === -1 ? 'Unlimited team members' : 'Up to ' + $json.planDetails.features.teamMembersLimit + ' team members' }}\n🔗 {{ $json.planDetails.features.integrationsCount === -1 ? 'Unlimited custom integrations' : $json.planDetails.features.integrationsCount + '+ ' + $json.planDetails.features.integrationsType + ' integrations' }}\n📱 Mobile app access included\n\n**Getting Started Guide:**\n1. 🔐 **Complete Account Setup**\n   - Verify your email address\n   - Set up your company profile\n   - Configure security settings\n\n2. 📇 **Import Your Contacts**\n   - Upload contact lists ({{ $json.planDetails.features.contactLimit === -1 ? 'unlimited' : 'up to ' + $json.planDetails.features.contactLimit.toLocaleString() }})\n   - Integrate with your existing CRM\n   - Set up contact segmentation\n\n3. 🚀 **Create Your First Campaign**\n   - Use AI-powered campaign builder\n   - Select from 60+ automation templates\n   - Set up email sequences and workflows\n\n4. 📊 **Explore Your Dashboard**\n   - View {{ $json.planDetails.features.analyticsLevel }} analytics\n   - Monitor campaign performance\n   - Track ROI and engagement metrics\n\n**Support & Resources:**\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.supportLevel === 'email' ? '📧 Email Support: support@atlasai.com' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.supportLevel === 'priority' ? '🎯 Priority Support: priority@atlasai.com (faster response times)' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.supportLevel === '24_7_phone' ? '📞 24/7 Phone Support: +1 (555) 123-4567' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.dedicatedAccountManager ? '👨‍💼 Dedicated Account Manager: We\\'ll assign your personal account manager within 24 hours' : '' }}\n\n**Quick Access Links:**\n- 🖥️ [Access Dashboard](https://atlasai.com/dashboard?welcome=true&userId={{ $('Initialize User Data').item.json.userId }})\n- 📚 [Documentation](https://atlasai.com/docs)\n- 🎓 [Video Tutorials](https://atlasai.com/tutorials)\n- 💬 [Community Forum](https://atlasai.com/community)\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.apiAccess ? '- 🔧 [API Documentation](https://atlasai.com/api-docs)' : '' }}\n\n**Need Help Getting Started?**\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.supportLevel === 'email' ? 'Email our support team and we\\'ll help you get set up.' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.supportLevel === 'priority' ? 'Our priority support team is standing by to help you succeed.' : '' }}\n{{ $json.planDetails.features.supportLevel === '24_7_phone' ? 'Call us anytime - our 24/7 support team is here to help.' : '' }}\n\n**Pro Tip:** {{ $json.planDetails.planName === 'Starter' ? 'Start with importing your top contacts and creating a simple welcome email sequence.' : $json.planDetails.planName === 'Professional' ? 'Take advantage of A/B testing and lead scoring to optimize your campaigns from day one.' : 'Schedule a call with your dedicated account manager to create a custom implementation plan.' }}\n\nWelcome to the future of AI-powered marketing automation!\n\n**The Atlas AI Team**\n\n---\n*Your trial ends on {{ DateTime.fromISO($('Initialize User Data').item.json.trialEndDate).toFormat('EEEE, MMMM dd, yyyy') }}. We'll send you a reminder 3 days before.*\n\n*This is an automated welcome message. For support, please use the contact methods above.*",
        "options": {
          "replyTo": "noreply@atlasai.com",
          "priority": "normal"
        }
      },
